      "side": 0,
      "message": "It seems like there is a path that is calling `typec_set_source_current_limit()` after VBUS has been enabled, but for some reason hasn\u0027t called `pd_set_power_supply_ready()`.\n\nI see some other boards use this model (set PPC current limit and then set PPC VBUS state) for their `typec_set_source_current_limit()`.  But I haven\u0027t checked if those boards enable FRS.\n\nMy concern is that this change is just masking an logic error in the common code.",
